  _lines:
  - 'Eventually I make it into a classroom. '
  - I'm late, but only by a couple minutes.
  - No one glances up at me as I arrive, and I quickly take my seat and take out
    my notebook.
  - I can't seem to read the words on the whiteboard, though.
